  "description": "EKITIF crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H74 Dy6 O34 S4,C2 H6 O1 S1,C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.488-3.959 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.37-115.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6O2(L1)6(OCH3)2(CH3OH)2(DMSO)4]·DMSO·CH3OH (C99H84Dy6O36S5; L1 = 1,8-dihydroxyanthraquinone dianion).",
